=== sample_009.png ===
>n

Maintenance Room

This is what appears to have been the maintenance room for Flood Control Dam
#3. Apparently, this room has been ransacked recently, for most of the
valuable equipment is gone. On the wall in front of you is a group of buttons
colored blue, yellow, brown, and red. There are doorways to the west and south.
There is a group of tool chests here.

There is a wrench here.

There is an object which looks like a tube of toothpaste here.

There is a screwdriver here.

>push all

group of tool chests: Pushing the group of tool chests isn’t notably helpful.
wrench: Pushing the wrench doesn’t seem to work.

tube: Pushing the tube has no effect.

screwdriver: Pushing the screwdriver doesn’t seem to work.

blue button: There is a rumbling sound and a stream of water appears to burst
from the east wall of the room (apparently, a leak has occurred in a pipe).
red button: The lights within the room come on.

brown button: Click.

yellow button: Click.

The water level here is now up to your ankles.

>get too_

